What are Medium Voltage Motors?
Medium voltage motors are industrial-grade electric motors operating within 1,000V to 35kV range (IEC 60038 standard), designed for demanding applications requiring high power efficiency and reliability. These motors are the workhorses of heavy industries - from oil & gas extraction to water treatment plants - where operational continuity and energy efficiency are critical success factors.
Unlike their low-voltage counterparts, medium voltage motors offer superior performance in harsh environments while meeting increasingly stringent global efficiency standards. Their robust construction and advanced control capabilities make them indispensable for industrial processes with continuous operation requirements.
